# | Column name                                             | Meaning / Description                                                                                                                      |
# | ------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
# | `male`                                                  | Gender of the individual — **1 = Male**, **0 = Female** )                                                                      |
# | `age`                                                   | Age of the patient (in years, integer/continuous)                                                                            |
# | `education`                                             | Level of education; ordinal — (e.g. 1 = some high-school, 2 = high-school / GED, 3 = some college / vocational, 4 = college)  |
# | `currentSmoker`                                         | Whether patient currently smokes or not — **1 = yes**, **0 = no**                                                            |
# | `cigsPerDay`                                            | Average number of cigarettes smoked per day (if smoker) — continuous numeric                                                  |
# | `BPMeds`                                                | Whether the patient is on blood pressure medication — **1 = yes**, **0 = no**                                                |
# | `prevalentStroke`                                       | Whether the patient had a stroke previously — **1 = yes**, **0 = no**                                                       |
# | `prevalentHyp` *(or sometimes “prevalentHypertension”)* | Whether the patient has hypertension / was previously diagnosed with high blood pressure — **1 = yes**, **0 = no**           |
# | `diabetes`                                              | Whether the patient has diabetes — **1 = yes**, **0 = no**                                                                    |
# | `totChol`                                               | Total cholesterol level (mg/dL) — continuous numeric                                                                          |
# | `sysBP`                                                 | Systolic blood pressure (mmHg) — continuous numeric                                                                           |
# | `diaBP`                                                 | Diastolic blood pressure (mmHg) — continuous numeric                                                                          |
# | `BMI`                                                   | Body Mass Index — continuous numeric (weight/height²)                                                                        |
# | `heartRate`                                             | Heart rate (beats per minute) — continuous numeric                                                                           |
# | `glucose`                                               | Blood glucose level (mg/dL) — continuous numeric                                                                             |
# | **`TenYearCHD`**                                        | **Target column** — whether the person developed Coronary Heart Disease (CHD) within 10 years (1 = yes, 0 = no) )              |

